The MIT license covers Studio 64's own code (web/, server/, tools/, tests/,
docs/ and engine/src/studio/). The engine in engine/ is based on sm64ex and the
Super Mario 64 decompilation and keeps their terms. No Nintendo game data is
included: you need your own Super Mario 64 ROM (and, for the Sunshine
characters, your own Super Mario Sunshine disc image).
